            </li>
            <li>Give children the time to think and speak.</li>
            <li>Allow children to do things at their own pace.</li>
            <li>Give children the skills and confidence to take the lead.</li>
            <li>Always plan for improvement.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="row-6 row-12-mobilep"></div>
      </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
